      "sentence_id": 113,
      "text": "\" \nIn the aforesaid circumstances, since in given set of circumstances, offence under Sections 406 and 420 I.P.C. may not go simultaneously as well as considering the above circumstances, that dispute appears to be a civil dispute, therefore, impugned order dated 04.01.2024 passed in Complaint Case No.13166 of 2023 under Sections 452, 406, 420, 323, 504, 506, I.P.C., Police Station- Shipri Bazar,\nDistrict- Jhansi is set aside and since this order is passed without issuing notice to opposite party No.2, therefore, matter is remitted back to pass fresh order within period of three months after hearing the complainant only.",
